 "issue_body": "`(80,\u2212120)`/`(\u2212120,80)` have opposite signs \u2192 classified Biconvex/Biconcave\n   by `lens.py:487-490`. Meniscus needs same-sign radii, e.g. `(80,120)`.\n",
