 "pr_title": "fix(constants): give meniscus presets same-sign radii",
 "pr_body": "The meniscus presets used opposite-sign radii, so they described biconvex/biconcave lenses and classify_lens_type round-tripped them to the wrong type. Use (80, 120) for Meniscus Convex (net converging) and (-80, -120) for Meniscus Concave (net diverging), keeping the original magnitudes. Add round-trip and power-sign regression tests.",
